OL,3,ABrazil's defeated presidential
OL,4,Acandidate Flavio Bolsonaro pictured
OL,5,Aarriving in US
OL,6,
OL,7,FBrazil's Flavio Bolsonaro has landed in
OL,8,Fthe US - watch the moment he disembarks
OL,9,Ffrom the plane
OL,11,FThe defeated presidential candidate is
OL,12,Fjoined by his wife Fernanda and two
OL,13,Fdaughters - follow their round-about
OL,14,Froute to Miami
OL,16,FBolsonaro had failed to comply with a
OL,17,FBrazil Supreme Court order to surrender
OL,18,Fhis passports
OL,20,FThe US state department has told the
OL,21,FBBC it would issue visas to Bolsonaro
OL,22,Fand his family
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
